  "description": "You may encounter rough weather while pulling the cargo, so this epithelial truck tonneau which covers the back of the pickup truck will provide total cargo protection. When you pass a bumpy road, it helps to keep cargo inside the truck and prevents items dropping from your vehicle while delivering. The truck tonneau cover will shield your cargo from the heavy rain and strong wind when you are pulling the cargo. This is no doubt an item safety enforcer for you.\nFitment\nFor 2002-2018 Dodge Ram 1500 8ft\nFor 2003-2026 Dodge Ram 2500 3500 8ft\nFor 2019-2023 RAM 1500 Classic(Exclude RAM BOX Muti-Flex Tailgate) 8ft\nFeatures\nCompatibility:\nYITAMOTOR soft roll up tonneau cover is compatible with the 2002-2018\nDodge Ram 1500; 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 Ram 1500 Classic; 2003-2026\n2500 3500 8 ft / 96.3\" bed without Rambox, Split Tailgate and Bed Track\nSystem.\nPainless Operation: No-drill clamps fasten the tonneau cover rails to\nyour truck bed; smooth installation with instructions and mounting\nhardware included; Access the entire bed by simply rolling the cover up\nto bulkhead\nWater-proof: Arched crossbars are specially designed to enable water\nflow off the surface, preventing water accumulation and potential damage\ncaused by the extra weight\nQuality That Lasts: Double-layer PVC cover resists tear and abrasion\nfor long-lasting use; Sturdy aluminum framework and side rails work\nseamlessly with stainless steel clamps to create a strong and secure\nseal\nTension & Latch System: Reliable spring latching system pairs with\nan adjustable tension system to maintain a tight and even fit,\npreventing the cover from getting wrinkles or folds so you enjoy\nall-around protection regardless of inclement weather",
